{
 "duration": 87.327,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Imagine you check into a hotel at 3 a.m.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.87
  },
  {
   "text": "The man at the front desk never looks up. He just slides you a key. Room 414.",
   "start": 3.0,
   "end": 9.93
  },
  {
   "text": "The hallway is so long, the lights at the end look like stars. Every door is shut.",
   "start": 10.12,
   "end": 16.46
  },
  {
   "text": "On your pillow, there's a card. No logo. No phone number. Just one rule:",
   "start": 16.854,
   "end": 22.74
  },
  {
   "text": "\"If someone knocks after midnight, do not answer. We do not have night staff.\"",
   "start": 23.054,
   "end": 28.67
  },
  {
   "text": "You laugh.",
   "start": 28.894,
   "end": 30.02
  },
  {
   "text": "Then \u2014 knock. Knock. Knock.",
   "start": 30.534,
   "end": 33.39
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Room service.\"",
   "start": 33.644,
   "end": 34.65
  },
  {
   "text": "You didn't order anything.",
   "start": 34.844,
   "end": 36.45
  },
  {
   "text": "You look through the peephole. A bellhop. Perfectly still. Smiling\u2026 too wide.",
   "start": 36.924,
   "end": 44.11
  },
  {
   "text": "He doesn't knock again. He just moves to the next door. Knock. Knock. Knock.",
   "start": 44.324,
   "end": 50.22
  },
  {
   "text": "And it opens.",
   "start": 50.4,
   "end": 51.52
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the next one. And the next. Every guest steps out\u2026 and follows him down the hall.",
   "start": 51.88,
   "end": 58.54
  },
  {
   "text": "Until the hallway is empty.",
   "start": 58.92,
   "end": 60.87
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, behind you \u2014 from inside your bathroom \u2014 someone whispers:",
   "start": 61.32,
   "end": 66.17
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Don't let him know you're awake.\"",
   "start": 66.25,
   "end": 68.18
  },
  {
   "text": "You checked in alone.",
   "start": 68.49,
   "end": 69.99
  },
  {
   "text": "Under your door, the light goes dark. Two shadows. He's back.",
   "start": 70.49,
   "end": 76.19
  },
  {
   "text": "So you have two choices.",
   "start": 76.57,
   "end": 78.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Open the door\u2026 and follow the others.",
   "start": 79.05,
   "end": 81.5
  },
  {
   "text": "Or stay\u2026 with whatever is in your bathroom.",
   "start": 81.97,
   "end": 85.37
  },
  {
   "text": "What would you do?",
   "start": 85.885,
   "end": 87.05
  }
 ],
